<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Russell downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Russell downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Carol Pope downgraded Russell Corp to market performer from buy, citing weak first quarter sales.</p>
<p>-- Said cut 1997 earnings per share estimate to $2.28 from $2.40 and maintained 1998 forecast at $2.70.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 8-1/4 to 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
